sequenceDiagram
    actor Receptionist
    participant Web as Web app
    participant API
    participant Pay as PaymentsService
    participant Iss as InvoiceIssuer
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    Receptionist->>Web: Select charges, type amount, pick account
    Web->>API: POST /payments/preview after 300 ms pause
    API->>Pay: preview, no locks, no writes
    Pay-->>Web: balance, advance used, paying now, to advance, invoice to be issued, blockers
    Receptionist->>Web: Receive Rs amount
    Web->>API: POST /payments with clientRequestId
    API->>Pay: collect
    Pay->>DB: same clientRequestId already used?
    Pay->>DB: BEGIN, lock invoices, then charges, then advance payments
    Pay->>Pay: spread exclusive tax on unbilled charges, plan allocation
    Pay->>Iss: issue invoice for the unbilled charges
    Iss->>DB: next INV number, INSERT invoice ISSUED, link charges, ledger INVOICE_ISSUED, audit ISSUED
    Pay->>DB: next REC number, INSERT payment
    Pay->>DB: INSERT payment_allocations, PAYMENT and ADVANCE_APPLIED
    Pay->>DB: recompute charge, invoice and payment totals with invariant checks
    Pay->>DB: commission entries, ledger PAYMENT, audit CREATED, COMMIT
    Pay-->>Web: receipt number, invoice number, allocations, new summary
    Web-->>Receptionist: Received screen with Print receipt and Print invoice
